(text "Fit R203/R204 for EM919x/EM929x only; leave both absent for RM520N-GLAA.\nSierra PCIE_DIS must be 1.8 V at boot; VBUS_SENSE follows the selected host port.\nAC coupling is at each transmitter: modem TX capacitors are internal; host TX capacitors belong at the controller.\nNative CM4 USB2 is recovery-only. No modem PCIe path and no connection between two USB hosts." (at 17.78 241.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e2253f98-37a4-56c1-8a9a-c2a96ccba89b"))
